Package: hscl-cqhecs
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: all
Section: science
Priority: optional
Depends: hscl-base, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv
Maintainer: HCSMEDIA <noreply@hcsmedia.invalid>
Description: CQ-HECS Studio launcher for HSCL1 (app shell, runtime on demand)
 A small launcher and status command for the CQ-HECS classical quantum-circuit
 simulator. The package itself ships no Python wheels and installing it uses no
 network. The isolated runtime (a venv in your own data directory, built from a
 SHA-256 pinned file) is created only by "hscl-cqhecs install-runtime --yes",
 which shows the download size first. Nothing starts automatically.
 CQ-HECS is a classical circuit simulator, not a quantum-chemistry or
 molecular-dynamics solver.
 Made with love by hcsmedia.
